      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CERISE (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Freya Legend (19.54) in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can find winning form. GOLDIE RUSTY (4) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 6 win two back at this track. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break off the middle. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. NO FIZZY DRINK (1) jumped favourite and was too quick with an all-the-way win last start (16.86) at this track in a Grade 6 over 300m. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Capable of going well again. WATCH AND SEE (8) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
